    "created": "20260924184744924",
    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>6级 游击</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>中型 自然界 类人生物</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 70；''重伤'' 35</span><span>''先攻'' +8</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 20，''强韧'' 18，''反射'' 19，''意志'' 17</span><span>''侦查'' +4</span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 6</span><span></span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">特性</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">擅长撤退</div>\n<div class=description>人类标枪舞者不会因奔跑提供战斗优势。</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">游击</div>\n<div class=description>如果人类标枪舞者在距离它开始移动的格子至少 4 格的位置停止移动，则它的攻击造成 1d6<br>额外伤害直到其下回合开始。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}矛（武器）✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：+11 vs. AC<br>命中：1d8+3 伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}机动攻击✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>该人类标枪舞者快步 3 格并在该移动中进行一次矛攻击。</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/range}}标枪（武器）✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：射程 10/20，+12 vs. AC<br>命中：1d6+3 伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''技能'' 运动+10</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 15（+5）</span><span>''敏捷'' 16（+6）</span><span>''感知'' 13（+4）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 14（+5）</span><span>''智力'' 10（+3）</span><span>''魅力'' 10（+3）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 无</span><span style=flex-basis:auto>''语言'' 通用语</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''装备'' 皮甲，轻盾，4 把标枪，矛</span></div></div>\n</div>",
